{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118285","id":3499512760,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7QllO4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118285","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118285.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118285.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118285","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118285/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118285/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118285/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7f6796a57205093bdc8fc385eab93f540dba0fbd","number":118285,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix over-removal of area overlaps when using Jolt","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118284.\r\n\r\nThe following flow is what's causing the error:\r\n\r\n1. Physics processing begins.\r\n2. A `RigidBody3D` moves to overlap an `Area3D`.\r\n3. `JoltPhysicsServer3D::step` runs.\r\n4. `JoltContactListener3D::_flush_area_enters` runs.\r\n5. `JoltArea3D::_add_shape_pair` queues up the `pending_added` event.\r\n6. Physics processing ends.\r\n7. Idle processing begins.\r\n8. The body is freed from a `_process`/timer/whatever\r\n9. `JoltBody3D::_exit_all_areas` runs.\r\n10. `JoltArea3D::body_exited` runs.\r\n11. We **both** erase the `pending_added` event **and** queue up a new `pending_removed` event.\r\n12. Idle processing ends.\r\n13. Physics processing begins.\r\n14. `JoltPhysicsServer3D::flush_queries` runs.\r\n15. `JoltArea3D::_flush_events` runs.\r\n16. The `pending_removed` event tries to decrement a ref count we never incremented.\r\n17. 💥\r\n\r\nThis fixes that by only queueing up a `pending_removed` event if we didn't have a `pending_added` event for that shape pair already.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n_Disclaimer: AI tooling was used in both finding the bug and in coming up with the fix._","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed",